<!-- FAQ -->
<section class="faq-section" id="faq">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="faq-layout">
      <div class="faq-left">
        <div class="section-eyebrow">
          <span class="section-tag">FAQ</span>
          <div class="section-line"></div>
        </div>
        <h2>Questions <em>answered</em></h2>
        <p>Still unsure? We've answered the most common questions below. Or just WhatsApp us — we respond fast.</p>
        <div class="faq-contact-card">
          <div class="faq-contact-label">Prefer to talk?</div>
          <div class="faq-contact-text">Our team typically replies within 30 minutes on WhatsApp during business hours.</div>
          <a href="https://wa.me/923437761250" class="faq-wa-btn">💬 WhatsApp Us Now</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-list" id="faqList">
        <div class="faq-item">
          <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
            <span class="faq-q-text">What condition does my old furniture need to be in?</span>
            <button class="faq-toggle" aria-label="Toggle answer">+</button>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-answer">We accept furniture in most conditions — from good to heavily used. The condition determines the swap value we offer. Even older or worn pieces have value. We'll give you an honest assessment for free with no pressure to proceed.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
            <span class="faq-q-text">Do I need to pay anything upfront?</span>
            <button class="faq-toggle" aria-label="Toggle answer">+</button>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-answer">No. The assessment is completely free. You only pay when you decide to proceed with a package. At that point you pay the difference between the new package price and your old furniture's swap value.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
            <span class="faq-q-text">How long does delivery and installation take?</span>
            <button class="faq-toggle" aria-label="Toggle answer">+</button>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-answer">We deliver and install within 3 to 5 working days of confirming your order. Premium packages may have priority delivery. Our team handles full installation — you don't need to arrange anything separately.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
            <span class="faq-q-text">Which areas do you currently serve?</span>
            <button class="faq-toggle" aria-label="Toggle answer">+</button>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-answer">We currently serve Islamabad and Rawalpindi — including DHA, Bahria Town, F-sectors, E-sectors, and G-sectors. WhatsApp us your area if you're unsure whether we cover your location.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
            <span class="faq-q-text">What if I only want to swap some furniture, not everything?</span>
            <button class="faq-toggle" aria-label="Toggle answer">+</button>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-answer">Our packages are designed as complete room setups for best value. However, get in touch on WhatsApp and we can discuss what works for your specific situation. We're flexible and want to find the right solution for you.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
            <span class="faq-q-text">Can I pay in installments?</span>
            <button class="faq-toggle" aria-label="Toggle answer">+</button>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-answer">We are working on installment options with financial partners. WhatsApp us to discuss payment arrangements — we want to make this as accessible as possible and are happy to work with you on flexible terms.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

